WEBVTT

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.810
Drink up.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:43.290
A Timid Heart

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:42.340
What brings you here in the middle
of the night, Prince Kai?

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:43.820
Actually...

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:47.830
Have something... I want
to talk to you... about...

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:49.510
Me?

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:50.830
Heine!

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:52.210
There you are!

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:54.830
It's terrible.
I just dreamt I was an octopus!

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:57.200
Slime. Slime. Slime. Slime.

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:04.970
Aaaugh

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:59.730
I don't have eight limbs, right?

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:01.580
My body's not all slimy, right?

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.960
I'd be chased out of the palace. I know it!

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:04.960
Master!

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.620
I'm glad I found you.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:09.580
Forgive me for disturbing you at this hour.

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:12.720
I cannot sleep until I
understand this problem.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.150
My apologies,

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.360
Prince Leonhard, Prince Bruno,
but could this wait until another occasio—

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:19.150
What are you all doing living it up
in here in the dead of night?

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:20.240
Seems fun!

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.190
My sincerest apologies.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.110
It seems it would be
difficult to do this now.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.490
Huh? What's up, Kai?

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:30.440
I need... advice... from him...

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:32.540
<i>You</i> need advice?

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:34.630
I can't see it.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.310
Oh! Actually, I need his help, too.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:40.300
There's this beautiful flat-chested girl and a
girl with an ordinary face but a gigantic chest.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:43.640
Which do I date? Which do you think is better?

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:47.310
I think you should sleep and never get up,
for the sake of all the women in the world.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:50.480
All right, Your Highnesses,
you are interrupting Prince Kai.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:51.690
Please see yourselves out.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.070
Aww!

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:57.320
Professor... it's okay...
It's not a secret...

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:58.810
Please, go on.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.850
What Father said to me...

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.820
Kai, I have no complaints
about your ability,

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:09.170
but you should work on your communication
skills and learn how to convey your emotions.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:15.590
But... I don't know how to
become a good communicator...

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.450
I see. So that is what brought you to me.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:22.260
As family, I understand you,

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:25.970
but it could be difficult for strangers
to read your expressions, indeed.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.270
And... sorry to say this...

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:31.850
but sometimes your gaze is so sharp
that I get a little scared...

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:33.790
What a thing to say.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:33.790
Gloom

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:37.360
I-I'm sorry! It was a lie! Kai!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:44.490
Father told me to become more flexible.
He pointed out flaws in all of us.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.770
You aren't alone in worrying, Kai.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:51.960
Yup. Hardheaded, small-hearted
Bruni has a bigger problem.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.460
He doesn't have the soul of a king.

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:56.180
I intend to be more careful about that.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:59.500
Oh, really? Do you have
it in you to be relaxed?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.420
Relaxed, relaxed.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:00.130
Smack

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:00.630
Smack

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.530
Relaxed, relaxed.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.260
Stretch

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:08.080
See? He's not relaxed at all.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.140
Being relaxed and never getting
angry are separate things.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:15.640
Not to mention,
Father told <i>you</i> to be more serious.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:19.800
But in my case, that's what makes me unique.

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:21.810
He is completely remorseless.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.660
And Leonhard, too...

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:27.070
You noticed, dear brother?

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:41.460
Proud

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:32.830
I'm the only one who wasn't chastised
for a personality problem.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.370
That is to say, once I overcome
the problem of my studies,

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.580
I'll be the perfect candidate for king!

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:42.090
Isn't that because your other problems paled
in comparison to your hideous grades?

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.100
I'm a failure...

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.980
Ouch, Professor. Way to be adult.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:51.210
Prince Leonhard is the type that
goes rotten if you baby him.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.930
Now, Prince Kai.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:57.480
From what I have observed, you are able
to communicate well with your family.

00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:03.630
I want to talk more with the palace
staff... not just my family...

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:04.730
Is that so?

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:11.240
And... I think when I look at someone...
they start assuming things...

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.250
Oh. Good morning, Prince Kai.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.470
Don't speak to me so casually.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:18.210
Don't speak to
me so casually.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:18.210
I'll crush you!

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:17.780
I'll crush you.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:22.080
Your tea, Prince Kai.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:26.270
<i>You would make me drink this
lukewarm muck? Useless.</i>

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:26.260
You would make
me drink this
lukewarm muck?
Useless.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.270
I-I'm sorry! Do you prefer it hotter?!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:29.350
His Highness would never say such things,

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.310
yet judging only by his appearance,
it is easy to imagine.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:36.510
When I think I might scare them...
I don't know what to say...

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:41.250
And when you are silent,
they fear you. A negative cycle.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:47.300
Shall I coach you to be able to
speak with the palace staff?

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:50.630
Communication does require a
certain amount of practice.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.360
I will help, too.
I cannot leave Kai by himself.

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:56.130
Me, too!

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:58.480
All right! I'll lend a hand, too.

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:03.540
Follow my lead, and you'll charm all
the ladies into coming home with you.

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:05.950
That is not the goal.

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:09.520
Well, Prince Kai, we will begin
first thing in the morning.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:10.290
Okay.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.510
Good morning, Prince Kai.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:17.550
Good morning, Kai.

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:22.560
I'm sorry, but Adele says she
wants to go to the zoo.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:23.800
Huh?

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:24.820
The zoo?

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.320
Yes. You see...

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.060
Wasn't that Adele?!

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.150
Adele! Are you okay?!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:42.920
Shadow ruined my favorite picture...

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:45.760
What is that disgusting picture?

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:47.620
Who drew that?

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.390
Bad Shadow!

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.520
I'm not playing with you anymore!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:54.550
I'm going to find a new friend!

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:57.420
Wait. Where are you going?

00:06:57.990 --> 00:06:59.270
To the zoo.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.410
The zoo?

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:03.020
I went with Grandmother before.

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:08.150
There are lots of animals.
I'll make a new friend there!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:09.990
I hate to tell you this,

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.450
but the national zoo is a fair distance away.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:15.450
You won't make it on foot.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.340
Unless you take a carriage...

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:23.700
P-Prepare a carriage!
We're going to the zoo, immediately!

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:24.850
Yeah!

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:25.710
Huh?!

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.100
And so we must go.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:31.460
Let's all go together, then.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:34.710
Okay! Thank you, Kai!

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:36.930
Isn't that nice, Adele?

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:41.570
Indeed. This may be a good
opportunity, Prince Kai.

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:45.370
Shall we begin with smiling
practice at the zoo?

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:46.310
Smiling?

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:51.210
Yes. A smile is a communication tool
that surpasses borders and language.

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:53.430
For example, like this...

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:58.790
A full-faced smile is enough to
give someone a good impression.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.800
H-How was that a smile?

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:04.270
Like this, Kai! This is a smile!

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:06.150
Model yourself after me.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:06.820
Okay.

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.710
Let us be off, then.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:15.590
So many animals!

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:17.580
Where should we start?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:23.680
Prince Kai, please walk around with a smile
as you look at the animals of your choosing.

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:24.600
Okay.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:27.370
Smile... smile...

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.660
Ah... smile... smile...

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.250
Kai! Time out!

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:39.110
You are smiling,
but it's a different kind of smile.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.880
At any rate, forcing a smile isn't good.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:49.080
Say, Kai? What's that bird called?

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.590
It's an ostrich.

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:54.530
Whoa! What's it doing?!

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:59.400
A courtship dance. It seems even the
animals love you, Prince Licht.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.270
By the by, that is a male.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:03.940
No, thanks!

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:06.310
Let's look at the bears next.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.230
They'll be so cute!

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:16.480
It's okay, Adele.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.310
It's not every day we're at
the zoo. Let's have fun.

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:23.490
Want to feed the animals over there?

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.570
O-Okay.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:31.240
His communication skills are quite
high when it comes to his family.

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:34.950
What is this?

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:37.510
What <i>is</i> this?

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:40.510
So cute! Eat up, okay?

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:46.330
Come on, there are carrots, too!
Eat up and get bigger!

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:50.040
Why are they avoiding me and only me?

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.800
I'll have to will them to me.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:54.400
Come to me... Come to me...

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:58.660
Come
to me...

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:58.660
Come
to me...

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.100
I believe that is having
the opposite effect.

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.470
Where has Prince Kai gone?

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.630
They've become one being.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:07.280
Prince Kai. Are you all right?

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:12.040
Surrounded by fluff... In heaven...

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:19.380
Glad to hear it. Let us take that happy
smile on to the next step, shall we?

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.380
We have run out of feed.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:27.100
Could you ask that attendant for more?

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:31.580
Ah... okay...

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:34.070
You needn't be so nervous.

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:38.320
Also, there is no need to force
yourself to smile as earlier.

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:44.550
For today, interacting naturally with someone
outside your family will be sufficient progress.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.010
Okay.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.700
Oh, boy. He's sweating up a storm.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:58.330
I've never seen him walk with
such heavy steps before.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:10:59.760
Will it be all right?

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:09.490
Mission failure, huh?

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:11.980
You can do it. Give it another try, Kai!

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:22.560
Ow!

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:23.950
Adele!

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:26.610
Adele. Are you okay?

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:29.620
The bunny bit me.

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:33.930
That must have surprised you.
Shadow never bites.

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.130
Yeah.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.770
Let me look at it.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:37.520
Okay.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.490
Can we go home?

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.780
Want to go with me, Adele?

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:54.910
Okay.

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:59.610
Do you think she really
doesn't want to see Shadow?

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.050
Perhaps.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:05.810
What's wrong?

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:09.910
I don't wanna go back.

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.830
What? Why not?

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:14.960
'Cause... 'Cause...

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:19.650
I was really mean to Shadow.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:24.840
I said I wouldn't play with him anymore,
and I'd make a new friend.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:25.680
Adele...

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:30.070
It's okay. Shadow misses you, too.

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:31.870
No, he doesn't!

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:38.640
You realized that Shadow
is your dear friend.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.280
Yeah.

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:48.320
Shadow?

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.740
Shadow!

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:55.760
I'm sorry, Shadow!

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:58.470
You're my best friend.

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:01.920
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Shadow.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.070
Happy ending.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.500
It's your turn next.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.260
Seeing you with Princess Adele,

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:13.390
I again feel that someone who cares
for his family as much as you do

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:17.810
should certainly be able to communicate
with the palace staff as well.

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:20.700
Is it my time to shine now?

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:24.710
I'll teach you my secret
conversation techniques.

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:27.560
Begin with a safe topic, like the weather.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:30.930
Then, ask what your
conversation partner likes.

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:33.190
When that gets them excited,
don't waste any time complimenting them.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:36.570
Like, "Your dress is so cute," or
"Your makeup looks great," and so on.

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:38.800
Those are pickup techniques.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:41.890
Be that as it may, they could be effective
in ordinary conversations, too.

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:50.970
How would you feel about putting this into
practice with those maids, Prince Kai?

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.130
Go get 'em, Kai!

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:55.000
This time, try not to pass them by.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:56.410
Okay...

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:05.230
Weather... likes...
compliments... weather...

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:06.850
Huh?

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:12.690
P-Prince Kai! What can we do for you?

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:16.270
Nice weather today...

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:18.890
Huh?! Oh, um, yes...

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:26.100
I like... soft animals...

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:26.540
What?

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.470
Why did he jump straight to that?

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:32.440
This towel feels like a soft animal...

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.160
U-Um, okay...

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:37.480
Was that meant to be a compliment?

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:41.430
W-Well... E-Excuse us...

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:42.110
Ah...

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.720
That didn't go so well.

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:47.040
Now, now. There's no need to rush.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:47.760
What's this?

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:54.990
Thank you...
I'm terribly sorry, Prince Kai...

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:55.900
It's fine...

00:14:57.050 --> 00:15:01.290
Helping someone naturally leads to
communication. An excellent idea, Kai!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.800
Keep it up, Kai!

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:05.420
I am so sorry, Prince Kai!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.050
We beg your pardon, Your Highness!

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:14.930
Your Highness...

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:19.440
I never knew my own brother
was that monstrously strong.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.100
What's that?

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.430
I'm not sure. It must be an intruder!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.030
Guards, charge!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.320
Go! Capture him!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:33.860
I can't apologize enough.
I didn't realize it was Your Highness.

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:35.280
My sincerest apologies.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:38.370
It's okay... It was my fault...

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.750
Nonsense! We are truly, truly sorry!

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.350
We're truly sorry!

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:44.450
It's all right, Kai.

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:50.300
I'm sure you'll be able to talk to the
palace staff, if we look for another way.

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:54.710
Where are you going?

00:15:55.200 --> 00:16:00.700
I don't want to scare people,
or be a nuisance. It's okay.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.570
Kai...

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:03.970
Prince Kai...

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:39.280
I'm sorry! I didn't mean to wake you.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.520
I'm sorry...

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:47.110
Um, I apologize for being presumptuous,
but the wind is cold today,

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:49.700
so I brought you some
warm tea if you'd like.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.720
E-Excuse me!

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:01.690
You need a lesson.

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:03.060
Prince Kai.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.920
Are you sure you should give up?

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:09.170
It has not been even three
days since you told me

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:12.510
you want to communicate
with the palace staff.

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:18.400
You were able to sense the complexity of
Princess Adele's feelings in no time at all.

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:21.770
You possess a sensitive and great heart.

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:25.030
You know how to communicate
with your family,

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:27.890
yet you cannot converse with anyone else.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:34.310
Before that, do you say your proper greetings
and thank-yous to the other people in your life?

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:37.680
Greetings... thank-yous...

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:41.910
No... I don't want to scare them...

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.540
As I suspected.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:48.750
You are so afraid of being feared that you
do not have the courage to say hello.

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:54.350
But no one will think ill
of you for being polite.

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:58.800
Won't you try starting with greetings
and thank-yous, for now?

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:03.180
But what if... that scares them, too?

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:06.310
Everyone has a different personality.

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:09.360
This means there will be times
when you have to give up.

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:14.150
But, on the other hand, it also means there are
people who would get along well with you.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:17.280
This is a large kingdom in a wide world.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:20.990
There must be tens of thousands
of people who can understand you.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:27.250
I think it would be a terrible waste to
give up because of only one or two people.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:42.150
E-Excuse me!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.350
I'm here to change your sheets.

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:49.930
I'm so sorry! I'll finish it up quickly!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:54.160
She's scared again...

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:57.630
Talking now might scare her more...

00:18:58.170 --> 00:18:59.040
But...

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:03.240
This is a large kingdom in a wide world.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.950
There must be tens of thousands
of people who can understand you.

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:17.630
Um... Yes?

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.840
Thank... you...

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:29.900
For always... changing... the sheets...

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:36.890
And thank you...
for the tea... I was happy...

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:44.870
Not at all! I'm not worthy,
Prince Kai. Thank you!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:47.350
Excuse me!

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:53.190
I didn't scare her...

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:57.540
When I talked to her, she smiled!

00:19:58.710 --> 00:19:59.760
Prince Kai?

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:05.550
Professor! I said thank you, like you said.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:06.600
Exhausted...

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:09.600
Is that so? You must be glad, Prince Kai.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:10.570
Yeah.

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:14.420
Wow, Kai! You got along with them?

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:17.770
So the tricks I taught you worked, did they?

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.570
I highly doubt it.

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:23.950
By the way, Kai, Licht was turned down by
both of the girlfriends he was wavering between.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.620
Hey! That doesn't matter right now!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:31.170
Forget about that, Kai. Tell us how it went!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.320
Yeah.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.150
That's amazing, Kai!

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:38.240
Please tell me everything!

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:39.160
Me too, me too!

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:40.980
Well done, Prince Kai.

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:40.030
Kai!

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:43.370
That is a very charming smile.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:48.380
Professor Heine. Will this frame do?

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:50.690
Thank you.

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:53.690
Ugh. It's that creepy picture again.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.040
It gives me a bad feeling.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.630
Isn't that the picture that led
to Adele's fight with Shadow?

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:59.940
Maybe it's cursed.

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:06.500
By the way, Professor Heine. Princess Adele
said she wants you to draw her portrait again.

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:10.620
You're kidding me.

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.470
Heine, you drew that disgusting picture?

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:14.880
Yes.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:16.920
I-I can't believe it.

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.190
It's beyond awful.

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:23.790
I am well aware of that,
but the princess took a liking to it.

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:26.640
Ahem. When I saw the painting again,

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:29.430
I noticed what looked like
a burn mark on the corner.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.140
Huh?

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:38.210
If it was near a candle,
the princess could have been in danger.

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:39.180
Thus...

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:43.410
Are you implying that Shadow knocked the
painting to the ground to save Adele?

00:21:43.620 --> 00:21:45.750
Yes. That is my suspicion.

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:48.190
N-No way...

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.210
Herr Shadow!

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:56.160
Shadow! There you are!

00:21:57.840 --> 00:22:01.140
Good grief. Don't go off without me!

00:23:39.300 --> 00:23:43.440
I drew to kill time when I was little.
Do you draw, Kai?

00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:45.700
I drew this the other day.

00:23:45.700 --> 00:23:47.570
Uh, what is this weird creature?

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:53.770
Next Time:

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:53.770
The Price of the Past

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:49.230
Next time, “The Price of the Past.”

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:52.420
It's fun to draw Shadow.

00:23:52.420 --> 00:23:54.420
This is supposed to be Shadow?
